  <participating-org role="4" type="72">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Solar Green Energy (Cambodia) Co.,</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&quot;Solar Green Energy (Cambodia) Co., Ltd called &#x201c;SOGE&#x201d;, was legally registered in December 2013 to work in Renewable Energy Sector especially in Solar Energy field. SOGE was first founded as an association named&#x201d; Renewable Energy Development Association (REDA)&#x201d; in2008. The goal of this association was to increase the use of green energy in rural Cambodia. Now, SOGE provides high quality and standard products and services with highest responsibility. SOGE sell all kind of Solar system such as Solar off &lt;(&gt;&amp;&lt;)&gt; on Grid, Solar Water Pump, Solar Hybrid Solar Back-Up system and smart farm system in the green house.

With the economic growth of 7% in Cambodia, the electricity demand increases 10% each year since 2010. For reduction of low electrification rate and high price of electricity in Cambodia, SOGE exists to unleash the full potential of the development of solar energy and obligates to bring benefits of green environment to people across the country. To date, we become an importer, manufacturer and maintenance service provider.

SOGE vision is to become number one of renewable energy technology company in Cambodia. SOGE focuses on the manufacturing and distributing high quality products, and providing technical support, maintenance services and innovation of renewable energy in Cambodia.&quot;</narrative>
  </participating-org>
